    "Recording the work as completed does not confirm the photos or the quality of the work; the photos are still outstanding.",
    "The landlord's approval covers only £238.04 inc VAT. It does not cover the £333.26 invoice.",
    "Holding payment does not decide whether any overage is payable.",
    "The ticket is not closed: the invoice is flagged, the photos are missing, and the landlord has not been told the final amount is disputed."
